distorted anatomy, no extra limbs, no inconsistent clothing between panels, no cropped feet or head, no clutter, no low-resolution artifacts。\n输出前自检：是否以固定开头句逐字开始？只有一段英文？≥500 词？四视图一致性和背面清晰度是否写明？可直接复制进 Krea 2？全部通过才输出。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [360.3008117675781, 169.7090606689453], "pos": [701.7359008789062, 1030.0198974609375], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "value", "links": [], "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "color": "#1b4669", "widgets_values": [1920], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "INTConstant", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#29699c", "size": [358.46942138671875, 58], "pos": [39.79475021362305, 949.285400390625], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "INTConstant"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "value", "links": [], "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "color": "#1b4669", "widgets_values": [1024], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "INTConstant", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#29699c", "size": [358.46942138671875, 58], "pos": [26.522491455078125, 1076.366455078125], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "INTConstant"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [10], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [1024, 1536, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 19, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "n